{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -80,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## GrunRay Wiki — 后端导览\n\n**Flask 只读 JSON API**：MySQL 存元数据，`content/` 存 Markdown 正文。\n\n- 受众：本地开发 / 运维初始化\n- 权威全文：右侧 **README.md** 文件卡片"
    },
    {
      "id": "source-readme",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 500,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4",
      "file": "backend/README.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "env",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "## 环境\n\n- **Python** 3.10+\n- **MySQL** 8+（推荐）"
    },
    {
      "id": "init",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 340,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## 初始化（顺序）\n\n1. `cd backend` → venv → `pip install -r requirements.txt`\n2. `copy .env.example .env`，填 **MYSQL_PASSWORD**、**MYSQL_DATABASE**\n3. **建库**：`python scripts/create_database.py`\n4. **建表**：`python scripts/run_sql.py` 或 `--file schema.sql`\n5. **导入文章**：Markdown 放入 `import/markdown/`，再 `python scripts/import_markdown_posts.py`\n6. （可选）**种子**：`seed_from_json.py` 会清空 `post` 表\n\n**排错**：\n- `using password: NO` → 检查 `backend/.env`\n- `caching_sha2_password` → 确保已装 `cryptography`（requirements 已含）"
    },
    {
      "id": "run",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## 启动\n\n```bash\npython run.py\n```\n\n默认 **http://127.0.0.1:5000**"
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## API 摘要\n\n| 方法 | 路径 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| GET | `/api/health` | 健康检查 |\n| GET | `/api/posts` | 列表；`type` / `project_id` |\n| GET | `/api/posts/<slug>` | 详情；`?html=1` 含 `body_html` |\n| GET | `/api/search?q=` | 搜索 |\n| GET | `/api/posts/<slug>/related` | 相关推荐 |\n| GET | `/api/music/tracks` | BGM 列表 |\n| GET | `/api/media/files/<path>` | `content/media/` 静态 |\n| GET | `/api/projects` | 项目列表 |\n| GET | `/api/projects/<slug>` | 项目详情 |\n\n前端：`frontend` 下 `npm run dev`，Vite 将 `/api` 代理到此服务。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "## 文章工具（代码入口）\n\n| 模块 | 作用 |\n|------|------|\n| `app/markdown_util.py` | Markdown → HTML |\n| `app/keywords_extract.py` | jieba TF-IDF |\n| `app/keywords_match.py` | 搜索打分 |\n| `scripts/content_tools/*` | CLI 工具 |\n\n更多：`scripts/content_tools/README.md`、`designed/template.md`"
    },
    {
      "id": "music",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "## 背景音乐 `music_track`\n\n- 表结构：`sql/schema.sql`；增量 `sql/music_track.sql`\n- 音频放 `import/music/`，导入到 `content/media/music/`\n- 访问：`GET /api/media/files/music/...`\n- 列表：`GET /api/music/tracks`\n- 导入：`python scripts/music_tools/import_music.py`（支持 `--dry-run`、`--tags`）"
    },
    {
      "id": "refs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 1310,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## 延伸阅读\n\n- 仓库：`designed/template.md`（导入字段）\n- 脚本说明：`scripts/content_tools/README.md`"
    }
  ],
